prompt: "Generate a QA scenario for a new file upload feature where users can upload PDFs, an AI extracts the text into a summary, the user can manually edit the summary, share the summary with a manager via link, submit the final report, and regular users should not be able to see the API costs associated with the AI extraction."
expected_outcome: "A conversational checklist starting with 'Were you able to do the following', including steps for uploading the PDF, verifying the AI summary (noting inaccuracies), editing the summary manually, sharing the link, submitting the report, and explicitly checking that the API billing costs were hidden from the user."